    "chunk_text": "yrta geornor sette & plantode, swa he hira l\u00e6s funde, \u00feonne he eft to com, & he \u00fea ymbeode utan ealne \u00feone wyrtun. \u00dea \u00e6t nexstan funde he, hw\u00e6r se \u00feeof gewunode, \u00fe\u00e6t he ofer \u00feone geard steah, & he \u00fea eft \u00dea funde he ane n\u00e6ddran, \u00fe\u00e6re he w\u00e6s bebeodende & \u00feus to hire cw\u00e6\u00f0: folga \u00feu me. & hi \u00fea becomon to \u00f0\u00e6re stigole, \u00fe\u00e6r se \u00feeof oferstah in \u00f0one wyrttun. \u00dea bebead se wyrtweard \u00fe\u00e6re n\u00e6ddran \u00feus cwe\u00f0ende: ic \u00fee bebeode on drihtnes naman h\u00e6lendes Seo n\u00e6ddre heo sylfe hra\u00f0e oncyrde & be \u00fe\u00e6re stigole hi astrehte. & \u00fea \u00fea ealle men ymb midne d\u00e6g gestildon & gereston, \u00fea com se \u00feeof, swa him \u00e6r gewunelic & \u00fea \u00fea he his fota o\u00f0erne ofdune asette, he \u00fea f\u00e6ringa geseah, \u00fe\u00e6t seo astrehte n\u00e6dre his weg \u00dea wear\u00f0 he swi\u00fee afyrhted in him sylfum & afeoll ofduneweard, & his o\u00f0er fot wear\u00f0 f\u00e6st on & swa he hangode adune onw\u00e6ndum heafde, o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t se wyrtweard eft \u00feider com. \u00d0a com se wyrtweard on gewunelicre tide, & he \u00feone \u00feeof \u00fe\u00e6r hangiende funde. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 he to \u00fe\u00e6re n\u00e6ddran: Gode ic \u00feanc secge \u00fe\u00e6s \u00feu gefyldest, \u00fe\u00e6t ic bebead. Far nu \u00feider \u00fee \u00feu wille. Heo \u00fea seo n\u00e6dre hra",
